# Agent tooling scratch. Both are session state that changes on every run, and
# neither is anything a checkout needs.
#
# .claude-flow was already listed here and still turned up modified in every
# `git status`, because gitignore does not apply to a file git is already
# tracking — ranked-context.json had been committed once and every session
# rewrote its `computedAt` timestamp thereafter. `git rm --cached` is what
# actually took effect.
.claude-flow/
.omc/
